The vendor GPADC has no input open/close callbacks. Runtime suspend stops
sampling even while evdev is open, so volume keys stop working after five
seconds. Keep the probe PM reference for key channels; remove drops it.

--- a/bsp/drivers/gpadc/sunxi_gpadc.c
+++ b/bsp/drivers/gpadc/sunxi_gpadc.c
@@ -2030,3 +2030,4 @@
 	pm_runtime_mark_last_busy(chip->dev);
-	pm_runtime_put_autosuspend(chip->dev);
+	if (!chip->gpadc_config.keyadc_select)
+		pm_runtime_put_autosuspend(chip->dev);
 
